Z||000000||JSocha||06-17-2001||02:41 PM||||You all know what I'm talkin about when travelin by car long distances, besides bad leads for you single people  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">, so, lets see what has been written upon the walls of those fabulous stretch the leg stop areas around the nation that you can recall and that made you laugh!<P>In BRIGHT ORANGE Spray Paint!<BR>They sand these walls to dull my pen,<BR>But the $h*t house poet has struck again.<P>I went to the John,<BR>It cost me a dime,<BR>Lucky me,<BR>I made it on time,<BR>I would have gone sooner, <BR>had I known I was loaded,<BR>For as I sat,<BR>My ****h*le exploded.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||10
Z||000001||KnightRyder31||06-17-2001||03:14 PM||||The cars hiss by my window<BR>Like the waves down on the beach<BR>I got this girl beside me<BR>But she's out of reach<P>Headlight through my window<BR>Shinin' on the wall<BR>Can't hear my baby<BR>Though I called and called<P><BR>Windows started tremblin'<BR>With a sonic boom<BR>A cold girl'll kill you<BR>In a darkened room<P>Ride on<P><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroJoe||06-17-2001||10:52 PM||||Here I sit,<BR>Broken hearted,<BR>I tried to poop<BR>But only farted!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joesig_1.jpg"> <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87||||reg||1
Z||000003||Songman||06-17-2001||11:52 PM||||At a little place in Nashville called Brown's Diner, where the Vanderbilt college students and the inhabitants of Music Row tolerate each other's exitence, the graffiti in the bathrooms are as famous as the cheeseburger special.<P>Unfortunately, I can't think of one thing that I have read there that can be posted on this family oriented forum...<P>One  of the more feeble minded and less creative ones is: Country music people suck...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000004||Rex||06-18-2001||09:19 PM||||The night was black, the day was blue<BR>around the corner a $h*t wagon flew<BR>a cry called out, a scream was heard<BR>a man was killed by a flying turd.<P>Those who write on $h*t house walls<BR>roll their $h*t in tiny balls<BR>those who read these lines of wit<BR>eat those tiny balls of it!<BR>||||reg||1
